                  class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium bg-accent/15 hover:bg-accent text-accent hover:text-white border border-accent/30 hover:border-accent px-4 py-2 rounded-lg transition-all">
                  📊 Open Daily Reports
